{
  "why": "Set API Keys leaves the PiAPI, ElevenLabs and Creatomate keys and the Creatomate template id empty for the user to fill in; every PiAPI, ElevenLabs and Creatomate request reads them. Filled with placeholder values on both sides. Notify me on Discord uses a Discord webhook credential, which the bench's generic dummy has no webhookUri for: `credentials` gives it a placeholder webhook. Placeholder fills only: no logic changes. See timeCompression.",
