  "timeCompression": {
    "why": "Wait 3min, Wait 10min and Wait1 wait 3 to 10 minutes, and Wait 5min and Wait to retry set only the unit (minutes), so Wait v1.1 waits its default amount of 5 (n8n-nodes-base 2.47.7 Wait.node: amount 5 for versions after 1). Waits over 65 seconds park n8n's execution as waiting, past the bench's timeout. Shortened to 1 second on both sides. This changes when the run resumes, not what it does: the PiAPI and Creatomate replies do not depend on elapsed time. Not a placeholder fill, so results flag it as time compression (config.nonPlaceholder).",
    "n8n": {
      "Wait 3min": {
        "parameters.amount": 1,
        "parameters.unit": "seconds"
      },
      "Wait 5min": {
        "parameters.amount": 1,
        "parameters.unit": "seconds"
